  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2007 2008 2009 2010 2011 2012 2013 2014 2015 2016 2017 2018 Jeep Wrangler JK 4 Door\nFeatures\nTailored Compatibility: Specifically designed for 2007–2018 Jeep Wrangler JK 4-Door models, ensuring a seamless fit and integration with your vehicle's body style.\nDual-Level Step for Versatility: Built with a two-tier step configuration, these bars provide easier access to the cabin for users of all ages. The elevated center platform is ideal for accessing the roof—perfect for clearing snow or loading cargo.\nRobust Build Quality: Constructed from thick, high-strength steel tubing, these steps support up to 550 lbs. A tough black powder-coated finish protects against corrosion, grime, and road debris.\nSimple DIY Installation: No need for professional tools or vehicle modifications. These running boards come with pre-mounted brackets and install easily with standard tools—no drilling required.\nFunctional Open Design: Featuring a perforated step surface, the design allows water, mud, and snow to drain away easily, helping keep the steps clear and slip-resistant.\nProfessional installation recommended",
